      "quote_en": "If the medicinal product is taken concomitantly with anticoagulants (e.g. phenprocoumon and warfarin) or antiplatelet drugs (e.g. clopidogrel, acetylsalicylic acid and other non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs), their effect may be influenced.",
      "quote_zh": "如果呢種藥同抗凝血藥（例如苯丙香豆素同華法林）或者抗血小板藥（例如氯吡格雷、乙醯水楊酸〔阿士匹靈〕同其他非類固醇消炎藥）一齊用，佢哋嘅效果可能會受到影響。",
      "verified": "2026-10-18"
    },
    {
